=== Computing XOR-Primes ===

The full problem likely requires computing a large number
of XOR-primes or summing them to a specific bound.

XOR-primes correspond to irreducible polynomials over GF(2).
The number of irreducible polynomials of degree n is:
  I(n) = (1/n) * Σ_{d|n} μ(d) * 2^(n/d)

